sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor FE as Frontend
    participant BFF as Checkout BFF
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant PS as Product Service
    participant PMS as Payment Methods Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over FE,RMQ: Pre-Checkout Flow

    FE->>BFF: POST /operations/pre-checkout {productSlugs: ["basic", "premium"]}

    par Product Retrieval (with caching)
        BFF->>Cache: GET products:active
        alt Cache Hit
            Cache-->>BFF: Product list
        else Cache Miss
            BFF->>PS: GET /products?active=true
            PS-->>BFF: Product list
            BFF->>Cache: SETEX products:active 600s
        end
        BFF->>BFF: Filter by requested slugs
        BFF->>BFF: Validate all exist & active
    and Payment Methods Retrieval (with caching)
        BFF->>Cache: GET payment-methods:active
        alt Cache Hit
            Cache-->>BFF: Payment methods
        else Cache Miss
            BFF->>PMS: GET /payment-methods?active=true
            PMS-->>BFF: Payment methods list
            BFF->>Cache: SETEX payment-methods:active 900s
        end
    end

    BFF->>BFF: Calculate total amount
    BFF->>DB: INSERT shopping_cart (PENDING, total)
    BFF->>DB: INSERT cart_item (for each product)
    DB-->>BFF: cartId (generated)
    BFF->>DB: INSERT outbox (CART_UPDATED event)
    BFF->>Cache: SET cart:{cartId} 1800s

    Note over BFF,RMQ: Outbox Relay publishes CART_UPDATED

    BFF-->>FE: 201 Created {cartId, products, paymentMethods, totalAmount, currency}

    Note over FE,RMQ: Synchronous Checkout Flow

    FE->>BFF: POST /operations/checkout {cartId, paymentMethod: {type, card|pixPayer}}
    BFF->>DB: SELECT cart WITH items, paymentMethods
    BFF->>BFF: Validate cart exists & PENDING
    BFF->>BFF: Validate paymentMethod offered for cart
    BFF->>BFF: Validate cart not already paid
    BFF->>BFF: Validate payment details (CPF for PIX, card data for cards)

    alt Card ending in 0002
        BFF->>DB: UPDATE shopping_cart (status unchanged)
        BFF-->>FE: 402 Payment Declined {error: PAYMENT_DECLINED}
    else Valid payment
        BFF->>DB: UPDATE shopping_cart SET status=PAID, paid_at=now()
        BFF->>DB: INSERT outbox (ORDER_CREATED with pixPayer if PIX, PAYMENT_PROCESSED)
        BFF->>Cache: DEL cart:{cartId}
        BFF-->>FE: 200 OK {checkoutId, status: APPROVED, paymentDetails}
    end